      "Thân": "<p>If you will not use strongSelf in the code suggested by Kevin Ballard then it might lead to a crash because of weak getting nilled out.</p>\n\n<p>Also a good practice would be to even check for strong being non nil at the point of creating      </p>\n\n<pre><code>strongSelf = weakSelf\n\n   if(strongSelf)\n   {\n       // do your stuff here \n   }\n</code></pre>",
